                    "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
                    "markdown": "自定义3DTouch菜单 它具有基于应用程序图标的自适应着色、可定制的分隔符以及锁屏和主屏幕的精致玻璃背景效果等！3DGlassierTouch enhances your iOS experience by dynamically customizing 3D context menus. It features adaptive coloring based on app icons, customizable separators, and a refined glassier background effect for both the lockscreen and homescreen. Tailor thickness, color, and radius to suit your style, with distinct settings for each screen. Experience a sleek, personalized touch with every interaction!",
